                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kumazuba aaciza, cilundu caŋanda ya-Jehova ciyooimikwa atala lyazilundu akusumpulwa kwiinda tulundulundu toonse, nkabela bantu bayookunka kulincico. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
