        },
        {
          "text": "Lino uyoobeteka misyobo minji akutapatila mikowa iili anguzu yakule. Nkabela bayoofula mapanga aabo abe maamba aakulimya, amasumo aabo abe zizibyo zyamisamu, Cisi tacikooyoobweza ipanga lyakulwisya cisinyina, nkaambo tabakwe nibayooiiya inkondo limbi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.3",
