        },
        {
          "text": "Banooyookede umwi aumwi mucisiko camusaansa wakwe amumukuyu wakwe, nkabela takukooyooba muntu naba omwe uubayoosya, nkaambo aya makani azwa kumulomo waJehova wamakamu makamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
