          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe nongazi yabutanga, cilundu camwana musimbi wa-Zioni, bulaboola kulinduwe. Bwami butaanzi bulabweeda, bwami bwamwana musimbi wa-Jerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nkaambonzi nolila cakukwiila? Sa nkaambo kakubula mwami? Sa nkaambo kakuti basinkuta bamana nkojatilwa insungo mbuli insungo zyamwanakazi uutumbuka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuciswa akusunga cakuzyala, O mwana musimbi wa-Zioni, mbuli mwanakazi uutumbuka, nkaambo ulazwa mumunzi akukala musokwe. Ulasika aku-Babuloni, nkabela oko uyoovunwa, Jehova uyookunununa kumaanza aabasinkondonyoko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ciindi ecino misyobo minji yabantu ilakuyobolokela. Balaamba kuti, Anyonyooke! Meso esu abone ncituyanda cicitwa mu-Zioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele tabezi miyeeyo ya-Jehova, tabamvwi makanze aakwe. Nkaambo wakabunganya mbubonya mbuli misunta yamaila mbiiletwa kucipolelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ciy 21:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buka, upole, o mwana musimbi wa-Zioni, nkaambo luja lwako njoolucita mbuli butale, ansumba zyako njoozicita mbuli mundalila, elyo uyoopwaya bantu banji. Imbono zyabo uyoozisaalila Jehova, abuvubi bwabo uyoobupa Mwami wanyika yoonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
